    <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
      <name>TheGroupHasNoSegmentsOfTheBan</name>
      <id>116</id>
      <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
        <name>TheGroupHasNoSegmentsOfTheBan_3</name>
        <id>118</id>
        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>DecorationThereAreNoSegmentsOfTheBan</name>
          <id>120</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>To block the delivery to the customer &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>add &lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>at least &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>one segment of customers &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>with flag&lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>&quot;The segment is used &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>to block the delivery&quot;.&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>برای مسدود کردن تحویل به مشتری، &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>حداقل &lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>یک بخش &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>مشتری با نشانگر &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>زیر اضافه کنید&lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>«بخش برای مسدود کردن &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>تحویل استفاده می‌شود».&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>Per il divieto di spedizione, il cliente ha bisogno&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>aggiungere&lt;&lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>almeno &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f> un segmento dei clienti&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>con la caratteristica&lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>&quot;Il segmento viene utilizzato&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>per il divieto di spedizione&quot;.&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>Dla zakazu wysłania kliennt powinien &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>dodać &lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>chociażby &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>jeden segment klientów &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>z oznaką&lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>&quot;Segment jest wykorzystywany &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>dla zakazu wysyłki&quot;.&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>Для запрета отгрузки клиенту необходимо &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>добавить &lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>хотя бы &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>один сегмент клиентов &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>с признаком&lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>&quot;Сегмент используется &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>для запрета отгрузки&quot;.&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>Müşteriye sevkiyatı yasaklamak için &lt;/> &lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>&quot;Sevkiyatı yasaklamak için &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f> kullanılan segment&quot;&lt;/> &lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>işaretiyle &lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>en az&lt;/> &lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>bir müşteri segmenti&lt;/> &lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f> eklenmesi &lt;/>
gerekmektedir.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>Để cấm giao hàng cho khách, cần &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>thêm &lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>ít nhất &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>một phân khúc khách hàng &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>với dấu hiệu&lt;/>
&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>&quot;Phân khúc dùng &lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:ad87bd29-0ad1-4da4-ac62-38e714e0cb9f>để cấm giao hàng&quot;.&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>DecorationThereAreNoSegmentsOfTheBanExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>122</id>
